{"c":[{"id":"5e4f97413b312154574a52b782dc0223d281329c033146c1f7175c8dbb73e1a5","sum":"Run: uses AGENT_BIN; help catalog uses CLI_NAME. VISION/ROADMAP retired; living docs are README, docs/architecture/ (atlas), docs/notes.md leftovers, and the memory-bank.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"667b5bd40e9be23ddeec380c5631a3fc8f731cf58d56db154c12dedfa451142e","sum":"Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem); help catalog uses CLI_NAME. VISION/ROADMAP sunset; living docs are README, docs/, and the memory-bank.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T023238Z-bbf825b6f524dcb6","text":"Nap Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem), same as the baked prompt; usage_text keeps CLI_NAME (summem).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T025054Z-8222dbc737ce85a4","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are being sunset: leftovers go under docs/; README and memory-bank become the living docs; VISION is no longer the design contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"5e022ef533bec84293259aa4a3c815b8633f4e3e47847b355f86fca71dea8117","sum":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md retired. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/ (the atlas), docs/notes.md leftovers, and the memory-bank. VISION is not the contract.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T025220Z-1a52749b783612ee","text":"docs-sunset plan: VISION/ROADMAP retire; architecture lives at docs/architecture/; leftovers (sqlite, hooks, cover(T), pack-size, hot margin) at docs/notes.md; README is the public face.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T030457Z-f1b0d73acb7f8b59","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are gone. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/, docs/notes.md, and the memory-bank. The architecture page is the atlas; VISION is not the contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"746cce2a386de2cd57d2f77ca19b292c0189cb60363f6c86944d9fead44d9a99","sum":"tox is py311-py314 pytest, no result cache unless proven on this suite; recall matches nested nap captions; zoom/recall warn 'skipped a pack' on an unreadable sibling children file (wake silent). Script-written files are part of the work; the script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"29530a97880a269e660dbdfe6943053f229dc80d93cafa9e9c7e269e0e3077e7","sum":"tox is the pytest suite on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10; no test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite); recall matches nested nap captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr for an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T034719Z-9ead1d6adb1f23f2","text":"Niko L2 tox-pytest-runner: one tox command for pytest on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10); skip test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T035449Z-38690d9f52484de6","text":"recall matches nested NapChild.sum captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr when they skip an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1cd145ba45ef49e6f3e7ca4db21d5e5f372f7e8b3109cdcf8637f9501cb76952","sum":"tox is the suite (py311-py314, no result cache). Files the script writes are part of the work: git-add them; the script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T040400Z-6f72c4e24f7307a3","text":"tox is the suite command: tox.ini package=skip, py311-py314, no test-result cache; 211 pytest. This uv only had 3.14.0rc3.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T044725Z-82b67eae5e042401","text":"After note or nap, git add the files the script wrote and commit them; the script stays the only writer.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
